WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.324
Unit six. Road Safety!

2
00:00:04.276 --> 00:00:07.946
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:11.267
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:14.744
Today we learn about Road Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:19.774
Sidewalk. Say it with me. Sidewalk!

6
00:00:23.274 --> 00:00:26.940
Traffic light. Say it with me. Traffic light!

7
00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:34.194
Crosswalk. Say it with me. Crosswalk!

8
00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:41.585
Pedestrian. Say it with me. Pedestrian!

9
00:00:45.094 --> 00:00:49.260
Bicycle lane. Say it with me. Bicycle lane!

10
00:00:52.757 --> 00:00:56.040
Signal. Say it with me. Signal!

11
00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:03.425
Attention. Say it with me. Attention!

12
00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:10.427
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

13
00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:24.073
I walk on the sidewalk and cross the street at the crosswalk. A pedestrian should always watch the traffic light and pay attention. I ride my bicycle in the bicycle lane and wear a helmet.

14
00:01:24.123 --> 00:01:25.273
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.668 --> 00:01:31.870
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.070
Crosswalk!

17
00:01:34.212 --> 00:01:39.190
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:40.390
Attention!

19
00:01:41.483 --> 00:01:47.913
Did you know? Bright or reflective clothing helps drivers see you better, especially at night!

20
00:01:47.963 --> 00:01:49.991
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.704 --> 00:01:58.805
Think and answer. What should a pedestrian do before crossing the street?

22
00:01:58.855 --> 00:02:00.005
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.368 --> 00:02:06.070
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:08.691
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

